28","id":3168753261,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6831Zt","user":{"login":"PixelTim","id":181008795,"node_id":"U_kgDOCsn5mw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181008795?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PixelTim","html_url":"https://github.com/PixelTim","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PixelTim/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PixelTim/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PixelTim/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PixelTim/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PixelTim/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PixelTim/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PixelTim/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PixelTim/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PixelTim/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-08T17:10:03Z","updated_at":"2025-08-08T17:10:03Z","body":"> It even mentions 24 bit audio so that is an issue at least in the documentation, can you test with [`4.5.beta5`](https://godotengine.org/article/dev-snapshot-godot-4-5-beta-5/) and see if support is also missing there?\n\nI checked 4.5.beta5 and the bug remains. Here are the error messages:\n```\n  ERROR: Format not supported for WAVE file (not PCM). Save WAVE files as uncompressed PCM or IEEE float instead.\n  ERROR: Can't save empty resource to path 'res://.godot/imported/DoesntWork.wav-5fb464281f6b9214ae48c1af0b5645fc.sample'.\n  ERROR: core/io/file_access.cpp:910 - Condition \"f.is_null()\" is true. Continuing.\n  ERROR: Cannot open file 'res://.godot/imported/DoesntWork.wav-5fb464281f6b9214ae48c1af0b5645fc.sample'.\n  ERROR: Failed loading resource: res://.godot/imported/DoesntWork.wav-5fb464281f6b9214ae48c1af0b5645fc.sample.\n  ERROR: Failed loading resource: res://DoesntWork.wav.\n\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3168753261/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3168764516","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109428#issuecomment-3168764516","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109428","id":3168764516,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6834Jk","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-08T17:12:04Z","updated_at":"2025-08-08T17:13:41Z","body":"That line should be from this check:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/80a219a58ad050519a8a51b76f7f43e15accc577/scene/resources/audio_stream_wav.cpp#L735-L738\n\nWhich checks the compression flag, so it might be that that's set and the other format check doesn't list it, or it could be that the importer reads the wrong data\n\nRegardless this error message could do with an improvement to show *what* format it actually does get","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3168764516/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3168845074","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109428#issuecomment-3168845074","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109428","id":3168845074,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc684L0S","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-08T17:47:34Z","updated_at":"2025-08-08T17:48:59Z","body":"Let's keep this a \"this might be a bug and not a documentation issue\" until we've verified it is in fact a documentation issue and not a bug\n\nOther code states that 24 bits *are* supported, and the compression entry is the problem here, I suspect the file is actually compressed, will try to do some checking","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3168845074/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3168858146","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109428#issuecomment-3168858146","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109428","id":3168858146,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc684PAi","user":{"login":"PixelTim","id":181008795,"node_id":"U_kgDOCsn5mw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181008795?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PixelTim","html_url":"https://github.com/PixelTim","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PixelTim/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PixelTim/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PixelTim/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PixelTim/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PixelTim/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PixelTim/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PixelTim/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PixelTim/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PixelTim/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-08T17:52:37Z","updated_at":"2025-08-08T17:52:37Z","body":"> Let's keep this a \"this might be a bug and not a documentation issue\" until we've verified it is in fact a documentation issue and not a bug\n\nOk, should I also change the issue description from:\n```\nGodot has no support for 24-bit WAV files, but documentation doesn't mention this. Errors that are spawned in the output panel if such files exist\n```\nto:\n```\nGodot has no support for 24-bit WAV files and errors that are spawned in the output panel if such files exist\n```\nor it is good as is?\n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3168858146/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3168862110","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109428#issuecomment-3168862110","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109428","id":3168862110,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc684P-e","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-08T17:54:30Z","updated_at":"2025-08-08T17:54:30Z","body":"I'd say to make it say that it errors when loading 24 bit WAV to not assume too much what the bug might be","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"