ull,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3169005584","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109428#issuecomment-3169005584","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109428","id":3169005584,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc684zAQ","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-08T18:52:05Z","updated_at":"2025-08-08T18:52:05Z","body":"That does make it seem like it not the bit depth but the compression, might be possible to extract that too, or just read the raw binary data","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3169005584/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3169020433","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109428#issuecomment-3169020433","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109428","id":3169020433,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6842oR","user":{"login":"KeyboardDanni","id":34800072,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0ODAwMDcy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34800072?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni","html_url":"https://github.com/KeyboardDanni","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-08T18:58:48Z","updated_at":"2025-08-08T18:58:48Z","body":"Working 24-bit WAV file for reference.\n\n[24BitTest.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21690074/24BitTest.zip)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3169020433/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3169040922","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109428#issuecomment-3169040922","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109428","id":3169040922,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6847oa","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-08T19:08:17Z","updated_at":"2025-08-08T19:18:16Z","body":"Indeed this file has the wrong format, the format code entry is: `0xFFFE` which means `WAVE_FORMAT_EXTENSIBLE`\n\nSo this is not a bug as far as I can tell, nor is it a bug with proper 24 bit format entries, this file is simply encoded in an unsupported format\n\nSo the solution here is to make the check more descriptive, and to maybe note somewhere that the format has to be basic PCM or IEEE, not extended format\n\nHere's the dump of the relevant file data (all this is little endian):\n```\n           00 01 02 03 04 05 06 07 08 09 0A 0B 0C 0D 0E 0F\n\n00000000   52 49 46 46 AC CF 02 00 57 41 56 45 66 6D 74 20  RIFF��..WAVEfmt\n00000010   28 00 00 00 FE FF 02 00 44 AC 00 00 98 09 04 00  (...�...D�..?...\n```\nThe relevant part is at `00000014`, `FE FF`, which means the extended format (`0xFFFE`)\n\nWe might be able to support it but it's not one of the supported formats\n\nConverting the file to a standard 24 bit version should solve this\n\nFor comparison this is the same entry for the other file sent:\n```\n           00 01 02 03 04 05 06 07 08 09 0A 0B 0C 0D 0E 0F\n\n00000000   52 49 46 46 82 87 00 00 57 41 56 45 4A 55 4E 4B  RIFF??..WAVEJUNK\n00000010   1C 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  ................\n00000020   00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  ................\n00000030   66 6D 74 20 12 00 00 00 01 00 02 00 80 BB 00 00  fmt ........?�..\n```\nYou can see in this case it's at `00000038`, and is `01 00` or `0x0001`, which is PCM","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3169040922/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3170613501","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109428#issuecomment-3170613501","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109428","id":3170613501,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc68-7j9","user":{"login":"PixelTim","id":181008795,"node_id":"U_kgDOCsn5mw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181008795?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PixelTim","html_url":"https://github.com/PixelTim","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PixelTim/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PixelTim/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PixelTim/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PixelTim/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PixelTim/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PixelTim/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PixelTim/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PixelTim/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PixelTim/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-09T11:01:26Z","updated_at":"2025-08-09T11:01:26Z","body":"Updated issue description to match the title","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3170613501/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3383598207","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109428#issuecomment-3383598207","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109428","id":3383598207,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7JrZx_","user":{"login":"vidaliATWIT","id":59701925,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NzAxOTI1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59701925?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vidaliATWIT","html_url":"https://github.com/vidaliATWIT","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vidaliATWIT/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vidaliATWIT/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vidaliATWIT/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vidaliATWIT/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vidaliATWIT/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vidaliATWIT/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vidaliATWIT/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vidaliATWIT/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vidaliATWIT/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-09T00:01:33Z","updated_at":"2025-10-09T00:01:33Z","body":"@AThousandShips [audio_driver_wasapi.cpp](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/9a5d6d1049e589ce0cac08f65367a084b252c18b/drivers/wasapi/audio_driver_wasapi.cpp#L365) shows the engine supports WAVE_FORMAT_EXTENSIBLE files whose subformats are PCM or IEEE_FLOAT. I've attached the relevant code for reference.\n\nDo we know what the subformat is for this particular file? This could still be a bug.\n\n```\n// Since we're using WASAPI Shared Mode we can't control any of these, we just tag along\n\tp_device->channels = pwfex->nChannels;\n\tp_device->format_tag = pwfex->wFormatTag;\n\tp_device->bits_per_sample = pwfex->wBitsPerSample;\n\tp_device->frame_size = (p_device->bits_per_sample / 8) * p_device->channels;\n\n\tif (p_device->format_tag == WAVE_FORMAT_EXTENSIBLE) {\n\t\tWAVEFORMATEXTENSIBLE *wfex = (WAVEFORMATEXTENSIBLE *)pwfex;\n\n\t\tif (wfex->SubFormat == KSDATAFORMAT_SUBTYPE_PCM) {\n\t\t\tp_device->format_tag = WAVE_FORMAT_PCM;\n\t\t} else if (wfex->SubFormat == KSDATAFORMAT_SUBTYPE_IEEE_FLOAT) {\n\t\t\tp_device->format_tag = WAVE_FORMAT_IEEE_FLOAT;\n\t\t} else {\n\t\t\tERR_PRINT(\"WASAPI: Format not supported\");\n\t\t\tCoTaskMemFree(pwfex);\n\t\t\tERR_FAIL_V(ERR_CANT_OPEN);\n\t\t}\n\t}\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3383598207/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3383678022","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109428#issuecomment-3383678022","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109428","id":3383678022,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7JrtRG","user":{"login":"KeyboardDanni","id":34800072,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0ODAwMDcy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34800072?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni","html_url":"https://github.com/KeyboardDanni","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-09T00:51:28Z","updated_at":"2025-10-09T00:51:28Z","body":"@vidaliATWIT This is Windows audio driver code, not audio file reading code. It just so happens that WASAPI makes use of `WAVEFORMATEXTENSIBLE` internally as its own output format (likely for surround sound support), which we're querying here. That's different from Godot itself supporting the format.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3383678022/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3383685462","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109428#issuecomment-3383685462","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109428","id":3383685462,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7JrvFW","user":{"login":"vidaliATWIT","id":59701925,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NzAxOTI1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59701925?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vidaliATWIT","html_url":"https://github.com/vidaliATWIT","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vidaliATWIT/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vidaliATWIT/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vidaliATWIT/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vidaliATWIT/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vidaliATWIT/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vidaliATWIT/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vidaliATWIT/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vidaliATWIT/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vidaliATWIT/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-09T00:57:44Z","updated_at":"2025-10-09T00:57:44Z","body":"@KeyboardDanni Good to know, thanks for the clarification!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3383685462/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]